:{"y":145.99608707427979,"x":112.92158985137939,"width":747.69599999999991,"height":132.16666376590729}},{"text":"Heavy Engineering Datasets: Processing and optimizing massive, complex architectural BIM, CAD, and Revit files without losing a single structural detail.","targetRectangle":{"y":278.16275084018707,"x":112.92158985137939,"width":708.07199999999966,"height":132.16666376590729}},{"text":"Hyper-Compressed Windows: Delivering photorealistic promotional packages within rigid investor bidding deadlines, leaving zero margin for cross-border rendering delays.","targetRectangle":{"y":410.32941460609436,"x":112.92158985137939,"width":732.6719999999998,"height":125.99999785423279}},{"text":"Image Credit: T-VFX","targetRectangle":{"y":1027.0835199356079,"x":972.55336856842041,"width":149.47199999999998,"height":33}},{"text":"The Challenge","targetRectangle":{"y":79.929818630218506,"x":69.899461269378662,"width":285.68000000000001,"height":75}},{"text":"THE Impact","targetRectangle":{"y":535.19570302963257,"x":69.899461269378662,"width":211.63999999999999,"height":75}},{"text":"M.YUSUF\/ CREATIVE MANAGER","targetRectangle":{"y":1027.0835199356079,"x":71.866631507873535,"width":240.65999999999997,"height":33}},{"text":"MY white.svg","targetRectangle":{"y":990.52099609375,"x":1752.7480268478394,"width":92.08904848547445,"height":101.11160712007768}},{"text":"ArchViz_Reel_T-VFX MENA.mp4","targetRectangle":{"y":3.375,"x":503.3497314453125,"width":1908,"height":1073.25}},{"text":"Cross-Border Team Collaboration:  Acted as the core on-ground operational link between the US executive board, Eurasian technical artists, and GCC real estate developers.","targetRectangle":{"y":601.26198673248291,"x":112.92158985137939,"width":760.00799999999981,"height":132.16666376590729}},{"text":"On-Ground Client Support: Separated spatial layout building from look-development pipelines, meaning on-ground client structural changes never stalled lighting or camera teams.","targetRectangle":{"y